		(uuid "068d61f3-8809-54c2-b0a2-37472df5daf3")
	)
	(text "3. VOC = 3.3 V x 10k/(33k+10k) = 0.767 V -> OCF trips at ~116 % FS (~77 A). OCF is open-drain; all three wired-OR on FAULT_N."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.96 137.415 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0be4f665-6739-5f24-92d5-7e3e1681bdc4")
	)
	(text "4. GAIN_SEL_1/0 tied low = range +/-66.7 A (internal 1M pull-downs; tied for noise immunity). VREF unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.96 140.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
